# Deutsch (German) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35; not yet reviewed line by line by a native speaker.
# Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = Fahrer, bike = Bike, lap = Runde, sector = Sektor, split = Split,
#   gap = Abstand (the Gap Bar HUD = Gap-Balken), PB = PB / persönliche
#   Bestzeit, standings = Wertung, pits = Box, penalty = Strafe,
#   session = Session, practice = Training, qualify = Qualifying, race = Rennen,
#   settings = Optionen (the menu) / Einstellungen, hotkeys = Tasten,
#   rumble = Vibration, notice = Hinweis, toast = Meldung, achievement = Erfolg,
#   profile = Profil, crash = Sturz, web overlay = Web-Overlay,
#   On/Off = An/Aus, Default = Standard, Auto = Auto. Ordinals: 1. 2. 3.
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, Companion, holeshot, whip,
#   scrub, oppo, endo, stoppie, wheelie, backflip, frontflip, turn down, FMX, OBS.
#   RPM stays English. Final lap = Schlussrunde, last lap = letzte Runde.
